OL,3,AJapan raises interest rate to new
OL,4,A31-year high to curb rising prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan's central bank has raised its
OL,7,Fmain interest rate to a fresh 31-year
OL,8,Fhigh as it continues to move away from
OL,9,Fdecades of ultra-low borrowing costs
OL,10,Fand as the country faces increasing
OL,11,Feconomic pressures.
OL,13,FIn a widely expected move on Friday,
OL,14,Fthe Bank of Japan (BOJ) increased the
OL,15,Frate from 1% to 1.25% - a level not
OL,16,Fseen since 1995.
OL,18,FIt comes as major central banks around
OL,19,Fthe world are hiking rates as higher
OL,20,Fenergy prices caused by the Iran war
OL,21,Fare helping to push up inflation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
