OL,3,AJapan raises interest rate to new
OL,4,A31-year high to curb rising prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the US Federal Reserve
OL,7,Fraised its benchmark interest rate for
OL,8,Fthe first time in over three years,
OL,9,Fwhile the European Central Bank also
OL,10,Fincreased its borrowing costs earlier
OL,11,Fthis month.
